# Build output and local scratch — regenerable or machine-specific, never source.
# Recorded here so `git status` stays a signal instead of noise. The handoff doc has
# asked for .claude/ and test-artifacts/ to stay untracked since 1.13-beta; this makes
# that a rule the repository enforces rather than a note someone has to remember.

# Editor/agent settings, specific to one machine.
.claude/

# Print Center output saved while checking that printing worked. The app regenerates
# these on demand, so committing them just accumulates stale copies.
test-artifacts/

# Scratch working directory.
tmp/
